    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Can you go deeper into those opposition arguments though? I'm hearing a lot about the impact on grid reliability and the potential for higher costs for manufacturing and heavy industry. Is there any weight to the argument that these mandates might actually destabilize the energy market rather than just being \"initial inflationary concerns\"?",
